iZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-28T08:14:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T08:14:41Z","closed_at":"2025-07-30T07:31:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3 - macOS Sonoma (14.1.2) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (16 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nCurrently, when reparenting a child from a parent with `scale.x == -1.0` using `reparent` with the `keep_global_transform` option set to true, the `scale.x` of the child is set to `0.0`, while its `scale.y` is `-1.0` and its rotation is `PI`.\n\nI am aware that the transformation `scale.x == -1.0` is equivalent to `scale.y == -1.0` + `rotation == PI`. I am also aware that the resulting transformation matrix is a result of a calculation.\n\nThis is an issue if in 2D, one has for example a player where many sprites need to flip, depending on whether the player looks to the left or the right. The most practical way to do this is to set the `scale.x` of the common parent to `-1` or `1`.\n\nThis solution breaks if the transform where scale x is -1 is transformed into one where scale y is -1 and rotation is PI.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the attached project, run the scene, and wait one second – the values will be output in the console\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reparent.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21464470/reparent.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"floere","id":3022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere","html_url":"https://github.com/floere","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floere/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109044/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}